; RetargetModifier3D between the Skeleton3D it reads poses from and the child Skeleton3D it
; writes to. The target must be a direct child or the node collects nothing. enable is the
; Position | Rotation subset of its three flags. use_global_pose stays false: true removes enable
; from the property list, so Godot never saves the two together.

